# Root .dockerignore — applied to every `docker build` rooted here.
# Mirrors apps/api/.dockerignore for the build-context-from-root case
# (Compose `build.context: .` with `dockerfile: apps/api/Dockerfile`).
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
**/__tests__/**
# 260530-rqk — scoped re-inclusion: the contract-test-runner image MUST contain
# packages/contract-tests' __tests__/ enumeration tests. The HI-04 drift guard
# asserts __tests__/negative-matrix-enumeration.test.ts exists, and that
# enumeration test (skipIf(!REACHABLE)) is the actual route-inventory drift
# check that fetches /api/_test/route-list in-network — without this negation
# both are stripped from the runner image, so the drift protection the suite
# advertises silently never ran in CI. Path-scoped to contract-tests, so the
# api/migrate/worker runtime images keep stripping __tests__/ everywhere else.
!packages/contract-tests/**/__tests__
!packages/contract-tests/**/__tests__/**
!packages/contract-tests/**/*.test.ts
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.planning
tests
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.log
coverage
.nyc_output

# TLS-05 / Phase 17 — dev-CA isolation (PITFALLS §13)
**/rootCA*.pem
**/root-ca.*
**/*mkcert*
**/*.localhost.pem
**/*.localhost.key
**/local.crt
**/local.key
compose/traefik/certs/
.certs/
